# Film pipeline

- Product names: Identity, Cinema, Continuity, Drive — never vendor model strings in UI
- Planner output stays shot-based (5–15s takes, hard cuts, duration buckets 8/20/90/120)
- Engine URLs come from `lib/server/adapters.ts` on the server only
- Without `*_API_URL`, simulated progress in `lib/store.ts` is expected
